   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>This section describes the process of accessing paginated results.</p>
         <p>When using the GET methods to fetch resources, the payload can exceed the maximum size for a single request. In this case, the results will be paginated.</p>
         <p>To know if results are being paginated:</p>
      </context>
      <steps id="steps_10492729">
         <step>
            <cmd>Look for the continuationToken element in the response body. For example, the following sample response JSON body includes a continuation token at the end:</cmd>
            <info>
               <p>{</p>
               <p>"records": [</p>
               <p>{</p>
               <p>"motorId": "feec0770-5013-4174-905e-55eba3b7e834",</p>
               <p>"sensorId": "00000479Y",</p>
               <p>"dataset": "vibx",</p>
               <p>"timestamp": 1599763309646,</p>
               <p>"data": [</p>
               <p>-0.65231,</p>
               <p>-1.81438,</p>
               <p>-2.31241,</p>
               <p>-0.32029,</p>
               <p>-0.32029,</p>
               <p>1.33981,</p>
               <p>1.00779,</p>
               <p>3.49794,</p>
               <p>3.66395,</p>
               <p>4.494,</p>
               <p>2.00385,</p>
               <p>0.67577,</p>
               <p>-0.98433,</p>
               <p>-0.32029</p>
               <p>]</p>
               <p>},</p>
               <p>{</p>
               <p>"motorId": "feec0770-5013-4174-905e-55eba3b7e834",</p>
               <p>"sensorId": "00000479Y",</p>
               <p>"dataset": "vibx",</p>
               <p>"timestamp": 1599763309646,</p>
               <p>"data": [</p>
               <p>-0.65231,</p>
               <p>-1.81438,</p>
               <p>-2.31241,</p>
               <p>-0.32029,</p>
               <p>-0.32029,</p>
               <p>1.33981,</p>
               <p>1.00779,</p>
               <p>3.49794,</p>
               <p>3.66395,</p>
               <p>4.494,</p>
               <p>2.00385,</p>
               <p>0.67577,</p>
               <p>-0.98433,</p>
               <p>-0.32029</p>
               <p>]</p>
               <p>}</p>
               <p>],</p>
               <p>"continuationToken": "eyJwayI6ImFkaybSIsInNrIjoxNTkyMIyNDUyLCJ0ZW5hbnRJZCI6ImFkaSJ9"</p>
               <p>}</p>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Retrieve the following result set.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>Include the continuation token as a query parameter, along with any other original parameters.</p>
         <p>Submit the GET request again.</p>
      </result>
